  "title": "Brett&#39;s Slow Cooker Loaded Baked Potato Soup",
  "description": "Simmer Brett&#39;s slow cooker loaded baked potato soup recipe with bacon in your slow cooker for an easy, comfort food dish that you can make ahead of time.",
